    "fetched_by": "LegiScan bulk dataset (gun-policy Stage 5 LegiScan check, California); operative text read by a Sonnet fill agent from the official leginfo.legislature.ca.gov text (Amended 2015-08-17, via LegiScan getBillText)",
    "fetched_at": "2026-11-13T00:19:36.330153Z",
